# Heavy / generated — keep Cursor index lean
**/node_modules/
**/bower_components/
**/.git/
**/.codegraph/
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.npm-cache/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
**/.vercel/

# Package compile output only — not **/lib/ (that would hide src/lib)
/lib/

.cursor/hooks/__pycache__/

# Build / package outputs
**/dist/
**/release/
**/temp/

# Generated / minified / maps / logs
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css
**/*.map
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Binary media & fonts (re-index when needed for a slice)
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.webp
**/*.ico
**/*.mp4
**/*.pdf
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2
**/*.ttf
**/*.eot
**/*.otf
**/*.zip
